#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0344 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a parameter, there is more than one value of ANRHI for a given value of ANRHIC
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt row=1
#expectViolationAt row=2
dataset ADLBC
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ANRHI type=Char
col ANRHIC type=Char
---
HEIGHT | Label A | A
HEIGHT | Different Label | A
HEIGHT | Label B | B
---
